  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUse your calculator to solve the equation. Get your answer as a fraction in lowest terms.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg width\u003d\"71\" height\u003d\"41\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_4_1_solvingequations_3a_30/image005.gif\" class\u003d\"middle\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
